-- The Mahjmont Society (Belmont MA): its Facebook page says "We are an American Mahjong collective ..."; Thursday 7-9 PM guided / open play at Oakley Country Club is reserved by QR code for $25 per person with no member requirement. Sessions on Cape Cod (Wequassett) and the ones without a venue stay NEEDS_REVIEW.
UPDATE "Club" SET "status" = 'ACTIVE', "lastVerifiedAt" = '2026-10-31', "description" = 'Its Facebook page says: "We are an American Mahjong collective specializing in connecting people through the timeless game of Mahjong with classes, community play, tournaments, and special events." Thursday guided and open play, 7-9 PM, at Oakley Country Club on the Belmont-Watertown line; reserve by QR code ($25 per person). Guided play is for people who have a basic understanding of American Mahjong.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'belmont-the-mahjmont-society' AND "status" = 'NEEDS_REVIEW';
UPDATE "Event" SET "status" = 'ACTIVE', "startTime" = COALESCE("startTime", '19:00'), "endTime" = COALESCE("endTime", '21:00'), "lastVerifiedAt" = '2026-10-31', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "clubId" = 'club_belmont-the-mahjmont-society' AND "status" = 'NEEDS_REVIEW' AND "name" LIKE 'Thursday Open/Guided Play at Oakley%' AND "venue" LIKE 'Oakley Country Club%' AND "eventDate" >= '2026-10-31';
