-- Carlsbad (club + 13 sessions) and Sarasota (Selby Library + the Federation's Mah Jongg 101) now have five or more active rows: published with intros.
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Mahjong at Deena''s runs American mahjong around North County San Diego, with guided play, parties and open play at places such as the Cape Rey Carlsbad Beach Hilton, inSIDE by Savvy Interiors in Solana Beach and Chauncey''s Pizza & Bar. The host teaches things like the Joker swap and helps players get their NMJL card. Check the schedule for the room and the start time. If you are new, a guided play session is the easiest way in.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'carlsbad' AND "published" = 0;
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'In Sarasota, the Selby Library hosts Mah Jongg for experienced players, and the Jewish Federation of Sarasota-Manatee runs a beginner-friendly Mah Jongg 101, a short introduction to American Mah Jongg on the Greenspon Campus for Jewish Life where National Mah Jongg League cards are required. Check each group''s page for the next dates. If you have never played, start with the Mah Jongg 101 class.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'sarasota' AND "published" = 0;
